OL,3,GNEWSACancer patient runs to boost stem
OL,4,Acell donations
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who has been diagnosed with
OL,7,Fblood cancer three times is encouraging
OL,8,Ffellow runners to sign up as stem cell
OL,9,Fdonors.
OL,11,FClaudia Adolphus-Green, 33, from
OL,12,FByfleet, Surrey, is to take part in
OL,13,FBrooklands Parkrun on Saturday while
OL,14,Fundergoing chemotherapy treatment.
OL,16,FThe event is being organised in
OL,17,Fcollaboration with blood cancer charity
OL,18,FDKMS UK, that will help runners and
OL,19,Fsupporters to register as potential
OL,20,Fstem cell donors on the day.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
